'''Guzzlord''' (Japanese: '''アクジキング''' ''Akuziking'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

