==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Guzzlord|80}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*The '''Breakcore''' attack is named after {{wp|breakcore}}, a genre of music.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

